        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "(“Carriage,” the “Company,” “we,” “us,” or “our”) was incorporated in the State of Delaware in December 1993 and is a leading provider of funeral and cemetery services and merchandise in the United States (“U.S.”).",
        "start_character": 50,
        "end_character": 264
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001016281-26-000021",
